~ start

Julian: Right. Everyone through the door on the right. One at a time.

do enter_right("Protag")
Protag: Do I have to do this?
Julian: You're the protagonist. You especially have to do this.
do leave_right("Protag")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Alyssa")
Alyssa: Am I the right size?
Julian: You're asking the wrong man. I only work here.
do leave_right("Alyssa")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Layla")
Layla: This had better be a flattering angle.
Julian: It's the only angle you have.
do leave_right("Layla")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Professor")
Professor: I have office hours in ten minutes.
Julian: This will take nine.
do leave_right("Professor")
do wait(0.45)

do enter_right("Troy")
Troy: You called?
Julian: Stand there. Look expensive.
do leave_right("Troy")
do wait(0.45)

Julian: That's all five. Press R to run it again.
=> END
